SUMMARY:CORELOGIC INC — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: CORELOGIC INC\nRoadshow: URL: https://dealroadshow.finsight.com | 
 Entry Code: COTALITY2026NOTE | Direct Link: https://dealroadshow.finsight.
 com/e/COTALITY2026NOTE (available now)\n\nDeal context:\nCoreLogic\, Inc. 
 (rebranding to Cotality) is bringing a two-tranche high yield offering con
 sisting of a benchmark First Lien Notes tranche (5NC2\, IPT mid-8s\, rated
  B2/B-) and $1 billion of Second Lien Notes (5.5NC2\, IPT high-11s\, rated
  Caa2/CCC)\, led by JPM and SPC as Joint Global Coordinators. The transact
 ion\, together with a new Term Loan B\, will repay $135mm of existing RCF 
 borrowings and refinance the entire capital structure including senior sec
 ured notes due 2028\, the existing 1st Lien Term Loan due 2028\, and the 2
 nd Lien Term Loan due 2029. Pricing is expected Thursday 7/16\, with an in
 vestor call at 10:30 AM ET and a broad syndicate of 15 joint bookrunners.
